<title>HUNGARY: SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT FINLAND 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT FINLAND 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary beat Finland 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup soccer European group 3 qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Ferenc Orosz (16th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000.</p>
</text>
